{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"95389","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/95389","key":"MC-121048","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"08/Oct/17 6:53 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Code analysis below uses 1.19's code, deobfuscated manually using the official obfuscation mappings for 1.19.</p>\n\n<p>Living entities have a <tt>CombatTracker</tt>, which tracks the details of recent hits. When such an entity is damaged, the combat tracker's <tt>recordDamage</tt> method is called to record it.</p>\n\n<p><tt>recordDamage</tt> first calls <tt>recheckStatus</tt>, which resets the tracked data if certain conditions are met. It then adds the data for the damage currently being taken.</p>\n\n<p>The issue here is that, when <tt>recordDamage</tt> is called for the killing blow, <tt>recheckStatus</tt> will clear the tracker due to the condition <tt>!this.mob.isAlive()</tt> being met. This is because <tt>isAlive</tt> checks that the entity's health is above 0.</p>\n\n<p>Looking at the method <tt>LivingEntity#actuallyHurt</tt> shows the problem:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\"><span class=\"code-keyword\">protected</span> void actuallyHurt(DamageSource damageSrc, <span class=\"code-object\">float</span> amount) {\n   <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.isInvulnerableTo(damageSrc)) {\n      amount = <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getDamageAfterArmorAbsorb(damageSrc, amount);\n      amount = <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getDamageAfterMagicAbsorb(damageSrc, amount);\n      <span class=\"code-object\">float</span> f2 = amount;\n      amount = <span class=\"code-object\">Math</span>.max(amount - <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getAbsorptionAmount(), 0.0F);\n      <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.setAbsorptionAmount(<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getAbsorptionAmount() - f2 - amount);\n      <span class=\"code-object\">float</span> f = f2 - amount;\n      <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> (f &gt; 0.0F &amp;&amp; f &lt; 3.4028235E37F &amp;&amp; damageSrc.getEntity() <span class=\"code-keyword\">instanceof</span> ServerPlayer) {\n         ((ServerPlayer)damageSrc.getEntity()).awardStat(Stats.DAMAGE_DEALT_ABSORBED, <span class=\"code-object\">Math</span>.round(f * 10.0F));\n      }\n      <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> (f2 != 0.0F) {\n         <span class=\"code-object\">float</span> f1 = <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getHealth();\n         <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.setHealth(f1 - f2);\n         <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getCombatTracker().recordDamage(damageSrc, f1, f2);\n         <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.setAbsorptionAmount(<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getAbsorptionAmount() - amount);\n         <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.gameEvent(GameEvent.ENTITY_DAMAGE);\n      }\n   }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>The health is updated before <tt>recordDamage</tt> is called, which makes the entity show up as dead and causes the combat data to be cleared.</p>\n\n<p>Then, shortly afterwards, <tt>die</tt> is called for the just-killed entity. This checks <tt>getKillCredit</tt> to determine who to credit with the kill.</p>\n\n<p><tt>getKillCredit</tt> will first consult <tt>CombatTracker#getKiller</tt> which contains logic to go through the combat history and pick out the \"best\" attacker.</p>\n\n<p>However this logic is currently irrelevant, as due to the above issue, the tracker will only contain an entry for the killing blow and nothing else.</p>\n\n<p>The solution here is to change <tt>LivingEntity#actuallyHurt</tt> to call <tt>recordDamage</tt> first, followed by <tt>setHealth</tt>.</p>\n\n<p>Fixing this bug will allow for the \"doomed to fall\" death messages to appear.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"15/Nov/17 2:37 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/124858","id":"124858","filename":"MC-121048.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName":"Avoma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"13/Jul/22 2:19 AM","size":"4.18 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/124858"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/124859","id":"124859","filename":"MC-121048.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName":"Avoma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"13/Jul/22 2:19 AM","size":"3.09 MB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/124859","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/124859"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"15/Dec/22 1:56 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"27/Aug/26 1:07 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"When an entity dies, the combat tracker only records the killing blow","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-121048/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2017-10-08T06:53:21.574-0700","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10098","value":"Platform","id":"10098"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Code analysis below uses 1.19's code, deobfuscated manually using the official obfuscation mappings for 1.19."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Living entities have a "},{"type":"text","text":"CombatTracker","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", which tracks the details of recent hits. When such an entity is damaged, the combat tracker's "},{"type":"text","text":"recordDamage","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" method is called to record it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"recordDamage","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" first calls "},{"type":"text","text":"recheckStatus","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", which resets the tracked data if certain conditions are met. It then adds the data for the damage currently being taken."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The issue here is that, when "},{"type":"text","text":"recordDamage","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is called for the killing blow, "},{"type":"text","text":"recheckStatus","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will clear the tracker due to the condition "},{"type":"text","text":"!this.mob.isAlive()","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" being met. This is because "},{"type":"text","text":"isAlive","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" checks that the entity's health is above 0."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking at the method "},{"type":"text","text":"LivingEntity#actuallyHurt","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" shows the problem:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"protected void actuallyHurt(DamageSource damageSrc, float amount) {\r\n   if (!this.isInvulnerableTo(damageSrc)) {\r\n      amount = this.getDamageAfterArmorAbsorb(damageSrc, amount);\r\n      amount = this.getDamageAfterMagicAbsorb(damageSrc, amount);\r\n      float f2 = amount;\r\n      amount = Math.max(amount - this.getAbsorptionAmount(), 0.0F);\r\n      this.setAbsorptionAmount(this.getAbsorptionAmount() - f2 - amount);\r\n      float f = f2 - amount;\r\n      if (f > 0.0F && f < 3.4028235E37F && damageSrc.getEntity() instanceof ServerPlayer) {\r\n         ((ServerPlayer)damageSrc.getEntity()).awardStat(Stats.DAMAGE_DEALT_ABSORBED, Math.round(f * 10.0F));\r\n      }\r\n      if (f2 != 0.0F) {\r\n         float f1 = this.getHealth();\r\n         this.setHealth(f1 - f2);\r\n         this.getCombatTracker().recordDamage(damageSrc, f1, f2);\r\n         this.setAbsorptionAmount(this.getAbsorptionAmount() - amount);\r\n         this.gameEvent(GameEvent.ENTITY_DAMAGE);\r\n      }\r\n   }\r\n}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The health is updated before "},{"type":"text","text":"recordDamage","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is called, which makes the entity show up as dead and causes the combat data to be cleared."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, shortly afterwards, "},{"type":"text","text":"die","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is called for the just-killed entity. This checks "},{"type":"text","text":"getKillCredit","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to determine who to credit with the kill."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"getKillCredit","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will first consult "},{"type":"text","text":"CombatTracker#getKiller","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" which contains logic to go through the combat history and pick out the \"best\" attacker."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"However this logic is currently irrelevant, as due to the above issue, the tracker will only contain an entry for the killing blow and nothing else."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The solution here is to change "},{"type":"text","text":"LivingEntity#actuallyHurt","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to call "},{"type":"text","text":"recordDamage","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" first, followed by "},{"type":"text","text":"setHealth","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixing this bug will allow for the \"doomed to fall\" death messages to appear."}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/10510","id":"10510","name":"23w03a","archived":true,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2023-01-17"}],"customfield_10055":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10037","value":"Combat","id":"10037"}],"resolution":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/resolution/10004","id":"10004","description":"A fix for this issue is checked into the tree and tested.","name":"Fixed"},"customfield_10047":"2017-11-15T14:37:00.000-0800","customfield_10048":null,"labels":[],"customfield_10049":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10077","value":"Important","id":"10077"},"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/124858","id":"124858","filename":"MC-121048.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName":"Avoma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2022-07-13T02:19:19.914-0700","size":4386837,"mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/124858"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/124859","id":"124859","filename":"MC-121048.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"